Linux AppImage runtime
- AppImage type2-runtime 20251108: MIT. It starts every InfinitePrep
  AppImage and links these libraries statically:
  - libfuse 3.15.0: LGPL-2.1 for the library.
  - squashfuse 0.5.2: BSD-2-Clause.
  - zstd: BSD-3-Clause.
  - zlib: Zlib.
  - mimalloc: MIT.
  - musl libc: MIT.
- To rebuild or relink the runtime, use its source and build scripts at
  https://github.com/AppImage/type2-runtime/tree/20251108 and the
  libfuse 3.15.0 source at
  https://github.com/libfuse/libfuse/releases/tag/fuse-3.15.0. Then
  replace the first part of the AppImage with the new runtime, or rebuild
  the AppImage from the tarball contents with appimagetool.

